			</h6>

		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="col-auto">
	<div class="d-flex flex-row align-items-center mx-2">
		<img src="{{ asset('assets/img/icon/icon-CA-2.svg')}}" class="me-2" alt="Rémunération" style="width:40px;height:40px">
